Final Flow Summary
1. Data is received from external sources (Airline APIs and Price Comparison Services) by the Price Data Collector Service.

2. Collected data is normalized and forwarded to the Alert Matching Engine.

3. The Alert Matching Engine cross-checks this data against stored user alerts and historical price data.

4. When a match is found, notifications are queued, processed, and delivered to users via their Mobile App.

5. Users can manage both alerts and their personal data through a consolidated Alert & User Management Service.

6. All key components are monitored and analyzed through the Monitoring & Analytics Engine to ensure smooth operation and effective troubleshooting.

